# No rewrites. Every route is prerendered to its own file (dist/jobs.html is
# served at /jobs, etc.), and Cloudflare Pages applies _redirects rules even
# when a matching file exists — so a rewrite to /index.html here would serve
# the home page's HTML at /jobs. Unknown paths fall through to 404.html (the
# prerendered "page not found") with a real 404 status.
